    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274916</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Klarth&gt;さん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Klarth&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もういいっ！
おまえとなんて
やっていられるか！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's it! I'm done!
I can't put up with
you anymore!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>勝手にすれば！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Do whatever you want!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、勝手にするさ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You know what? Yeah, I think I will!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>君たちは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, it's you two...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……行くぞ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Let's go!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あっ……行くって……
どこへ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh, but... Where
are we going...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>行っちゃった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And he's gone...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルー……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleu...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……あら、あなたたち……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Oh dear, so you were here...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……あの……その……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Um...that's...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……うふふ……
みっともないとこ、
見せちゃったかしら</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Ahaha... I suppose we
let you see something
we shouldn't have.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ケンカ……したのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You were...fighting?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まぁね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mm, yes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ダメね、何年たっても、
あの人とはケンカしてばっか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's not good, is it? We've spent
all these years together, yet we
still fight so much...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大体、あの人のこと、
理解してるけど、やっぱり
まだぶつかることもあるわね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>For the most part, I understand
him very well, but there are still
things we butt heads over...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレと&lt;Mel&gt;だって、
ケンカばっかだぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Me and &lt;Mel&gt; are
always fighting, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275940</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だって、ひとこと、言わずには
いられないことばっかり
&lt;Dio&gt;がやるからでしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But isn't that because you're
always doing things I have to
scold you for, &lt;Dio&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そういうこと、かもね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe that's just how it is...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人間同士、何も言わないで
互いの関係は築けない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>As humans, if we don't talk to
each other, we can't develop
deeper relationships...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>口を開けば、考えの違いで
ぶつかるのは、さけられない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But when we open our mouths,
we find our thoughts are different.
And so, we butt heads over them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>以心伝心って
難しいわよねぇ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I guess telepathy's a
bit much to ask for.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ……
へんな話しちゃったわね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah... This is an awkward
subject, isn't it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とにかく……あの人の
ことよろしくね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anyway... Please look
after him for me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よろしくって……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Look after him for you...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276424</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>たぶん、あの人、少し、
頭を冷やしたいって
思ってるだろうから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, I'm sure he
needs a little time
to cool off, so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276424</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私もたまには
ひとりになりたいしね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And once in a while, I need
some time alone, myself.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
